---
import { LINKS } from "../../data/site.js";
import Section from "../Section.astro";
---

<Section tone="surface">
  <div class="closing">
    <div class="cell">
      <h2>Ready to curate?</h2>
      <p>Install the CLI, run <code>inspect</code> on a folder, and see what it would keep before you commit to a threshold.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button is-outline" href="/docs">Read the docs</a>
        <a class="text-link" href={LINKS.github}>View on GitHub <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cell">
      <h2>Check the evidence first</h2>
      <p>Real-speech results, benchmark tables, the bugs testing found, and what AeroSieve still cannot do.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button is-outline" href="/proof">See the proof</a>
        <a class="text-link" href={LINKS.changelog}>Changelog <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .closing { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .cell { padding: 72px 64px; }
  .cell + .cell { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  h2 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; }
  p { margin-top: 18px; max-width: 46ch; color: var(--muted); }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 24px; margin-top: 40px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .closing { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cell { padding: 48px 20px; }
    .cell + .cell { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  }
</style>
